          "id": 1622982656,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Another example to support the safety of using the range-based for loop with a `const QModelIndexList &` can be found at https://github.com/qt/qtbase/blob/v6.6.0/src/corelib/itemmodels/qabstractitemmodel.cpp#L2741-L2743\n```c++\nvoid QAbstractItemModel::encodeData(const QModelIndexList &indexes, QDataStream &stream) const\n{\n    for (const auto &index : indexes)\n```\n\nThanks for the extra eyes, I'll go ahead and merge this!",
