      "title": "Qt: remove use of qAsConst which is deprecated in Qt 6.6",
      "message": "Qt: remove use of qAsConst which is deprecated in Qt 6.6\n\nThe parameters passed to qAsConst are already of type `const T&`, so we\ndo not need `qAsConst`. Remove it to address deprecation warnings.\n\nSee also https://www.kdab.com/blog-qasconst-and-stdas_const/\n",
